  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 180C.",
    "Mix olive oil, cumin, garlic, lemon juice, salt, pepper, oregano, and rosemary in a bowl.",
    "Rub the mixture all over the pork roast.",
    "Place the roast in a roasting pan with carrots, onions, and pour water or broth around it.",
    "Roast for 100 minutes, covering if the top begins to brown.",
    "Turn oven temperature to 220C and broil for 5 minutes until the crust is golden.",
    "Remove the roast, let it rest for 10 minutes before slicing.",
    "Serve slices with roasted vegetables.",
    "Cook pork to an internal temperature of 63°C / 145°F and let it rest for 3 minutes before serving."
